  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "83DEAF0936B4C932",
      "text": "Ich erinnere mich noch sehr gut daran, mit wie\\nviel Wucht du den Olivenball gerollt hast![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "83DEAE0936B4C77F",
      "text": "Man hätte fast meinen können, du wärst zum\\nTyp Kampf terakristallisiert![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "83DEAD0936B4C5CC",
      "text": "In wie vielen Arenen hattest du damals vor\\nmeiner schon vorbeigeschaut?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "83DEAC0936B4C419",
      "text": "Von der Akademie ist es nur ein Mauzisprung\\nzur Moldrid-Arena, also schauen viele Trainer\\r\\nzuerst bei uns vorbei.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "83DEAB0936B4C266",
      "text": "Deshalb hat mich der Top-Champ auch gebeten,\\ndie Herausforderer ein wenig in Zuckerwatte zu\\r\\npacken, wenn du verstehst, was ich meine, hihihi.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "83DEAA0936B4C0B3",
      "text": "Das ist zwar lieb, aber meine Käfer-Pokémon\\nhaben deswegen ganz schön oft im Kampf das\\r\\nNachsehen... Sie tun mir richtig leid, die Armen![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "83DEA90936B4BF00",
      "text": "Umso dankbarer sind wir also für Gelegenheiten\\nwie diese, wo wir uns nicht zurückhalten müssen,\\r\\nsondern richtig auf den Putz hauen dürfen![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "83DEB80936B4D87D",
      "text": "Dann werden wir dich jetzt mal schonungslos zu\\nMürbeteig verarbeiten![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "83DEB70936B4D6CA",
      "text": "Das war beeindruckend, Hut ab! Du stehst dem\\nTop-Champ echt in nichts nach...[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "83DBAA0936B28ADC",
      "text": "Hach, du kannst dir gar nicht vorstellen,\\nwie honigsüß eine Niederlage schmecken kann,\\r\\nwenn man sich endlich mal austoben durfte![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_11",
      "hash64": "83DBAB0936B28C8F",
      "text": "So langsam glaube ich, dass es niemandem hilft,\\nwenn man es Herausforderern allzu leicht macht.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_12",
      "hash64": "83DBAC0936B28E42",
      "text": "Meisterkoch Kombu hat mir schließlich auch dazu\\ngeraten, meinem Gebäck eine eigene Note zu\\r\\nverleihen.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_13",
      "hash64": "83DBAD0936B28FF5",
      "text": "Ja, das werde ich von nun an auch mit meinen\\nKämpfen tun![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_14",
      "hash64": "83DBA60936B28410",
      "text": "Hm, und wenn Trainer dann darüber jammern,\\ndass meine Arena zu schwer geworden sei...\\c\\nDann erkläre ich ihnen, dass man hin und wieder\\neine bittere Note im Leben braucht, um die\\r\\nsüßen Seiten richtig schätzen zu können.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 223,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_020_mushi_15",
      "hash64": "83DBA70936B285C3",
      "text": "Also dann, wir sehen uns![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
